G["BURN! You wretches! BURN!"]="ARDED! Desdichados! ARDED!"
G["BURN, BABY, BURN!"]="ARDE, NENA, ARDE!"
G["BURNINATE!"]="ARDED!"
G["BURNS! IT BURNS!"]="QUEMA! QUEMA!"
G["BUT STAY AWAY FROM THE  BIG VILLAGE! There's dozens o' mad ice trolls in there! Oh, that Zandalari priest has 'em whipped up into a great frenzy."]="Mas manteneos longe da aldeia grande! Está cheia de trolls de gelo chalados! Oh... Esse sacerdote Zandalari os tem sublevado."
G["BUTCHER! DIE!"]="CARNICEIRO! MORRE!"
