G["Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, $n."]="Caerne nos tem trazido a uma terra fértil com possibilidades de futuro. Somos afortunados e, a caminho, devemos passar nossa boa fortuna a outros. Essa é a razão de que comenzase a ensenhar, $n."
G["Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me."]="O próprio Cairne mora aqui, dizem eles. Quando terminar de criar um presente adequado, vou procurá-o. Talvez ele tenha palavras de sabedoria pai mim."
G["Cakes, pastries, even bread - anything but cheese!"]="Tartas, repostería, inclusive pan... Qualquer coisa menos queijo!"
