G["Constructing defense mechanism."]="Construyendo mecanismo de defesa."
G["Constructs, defend the capital at all costs!"]="Ensamblagens, defended a capital custe o que custe!"
G["Consume $n, my children!"]="Consumid a $n, meus pequenos!"
