G["Discovering the power in these shards gave me the will to drag myself out of the gutter and get my life together.\n\nOh, and also I was kicked out."]="Descobrir o poder de estes fragmentos me dio a vontade necessário pai sair das cloacas e rehacer minha vida.\n\nBom, e além me echaron."
