G["How did you escape?"]="Como escapaste?"
G["How did you even stand Jaloot? Whenever he talks, I want to go dump him at Frenzyheart Hill."]="Como soportas a Jaloot? Sempre que fala, me entran ganha de lanzarlo à Colina Coração Frenético."
G["How did you find me!?"]="Como me encontrado?"
G["How did you find me?  It matters little... you will die!"]="Como me encontrado? Não importa... Morrerá!"
