G["Hozen grookin' slicky wikket!"]="Hozen jeringa a makaku manduko!"
G["Hozen have all you treasure now, off-lander."]="Agoraos hozen têm seus tesouros, $gestranho:estranha;."
G["Hozen in the Mist."]="Hozen na névoa."
G["Hozen law number two... Tresspassers get ooked in the dooker!"]="Ley hozen número dois... Pukar intrusos nos wakus!"
