G["Kill them before they grow!"]="Mátalos antes de que crezcan!"
G["Kill them!"]="Madadelos!"
G["Kill them!  Kill them all!"]="Mátalos! Mátalos a todos!"
G["Kill them! Kill all!"]="Matar! Matarlos a todos!"
G["Kill them! Kill them all and take back Zim'Torga!"]="Mátalos! Mátalos e recuperada Zim'torga!"
