G["May our bond with you never be broken again, spirit."]="Que nosso vínculo não fique a romperse nunca, espírito."
G["May peace find you now."]="Que descanses em paz."
G["May the Deadmines serve as your tomb, $n!"]="Que As Minas da Morte te sirvan de tumba, $n!"
