G["May the sacred pools bless you."]="Que as Poços Sagradas te bendigan."
G["May the spirit of Isha Awak give you strength, $n."]="Que o espírito de Isha Awak te dé força, $n."
G["May the spirit of the Great Tree shelter you..."]="Que o espírito do Grande Árvore te guarde..."
G["May the spirits aid you."]="Que os espíritos te ayuden."
G["May the spirits be with you, brave one."]="Que os espíritos te guíen, corajoso."
G["May the spirits be with you."]="Que os espíritos estejam com você."
