G["Playful Azure Serpent is hungry!"]="Dragão lazúli brincalhão tem fome!"
G["Playful Azure Serpent licks itself."]="Dragão lazúli brincalhão se lame."
G["Playful Azure Serpent needs some love!"]="Dragão lazúli brincalhão quer mimos!"
