G["The Alliance has lost control of the Draenei Ruins!"]="A Aliança tem perdido as Ruínas Draeneis!"
G["The Alliance has lost control of the Fel Reaver Ruins!"]="A Aliança tem perdido o controle das ruínas do Assaltante Vil!"
G["The Alliance has lost control of the Goblin Mine!"]="A Aliança tem perdido o controle da Mina Goblin!"
G["The Alliance has lost control of the Ironclad Garrison!"]="A Aliança tem perdido o controle do Cuartel do Blindado!"
G["The Alliance has lost control of the Lava Depot!"]="A Aliança tem perdido o Almacén de Lava!"
