G["The Alliance has taken the lumber mill!"]="A Aliança tomou o serraria!"
G["The Alliance has taken the mine!"]="A Aliança tomou a mina!"
G["The Alliance has taken the mines!"]="A Aliança tomou as minas!"
G["The Alliance has taken the oil refinery!"]="A Aliança tomou a Refinaria!"
