G["The Horde has taken the Draenei Ruins!"]="A Horda tomou as Ruínas Draeneis!"
G["The Horde has taken the Fel Reaver Ruins!"]="A Horda tomou as Ruínas do Assaltante Vil!"
G["The Horde has taken the Ironclad Garrison!"]="A Horda tomou o Cuartel do Blindado!"
G["The Horde has taken the Irondeep Mine!  Its supplies will now be used for reinforcements!"]="A Horda capturou a Mina Ferrofundo! Agora usarão seus suprimentos como reforços!"
G["The Horde has taken the Mage Tower!"]="A Horda tomou a Torre dos Magos!"
