G["The Horde has taken the farm!"]="A Horda tomou a fazenda!"
G["The Horde has taken the hangar!"]="A Horda tomou o Hangar!"
G["The Horde has taken the horde keep!"]="A Horda tomou a fortaleza da Horda!"
G["The Horde has taken the lighthouse!"]="A Horda tomou o farol!"
G["The Horde has taken the lumber mill!"]="A Horda tomou o serraria!"
G["The Horde has taken the mine!"]="A Horda tomou a mina!"
G["The Horde has taken the mines!"]="A Horda tomou as minas!"
