G["What are you doing here!?"]="Que faz você aqui?!"
G["What are you doing here, $r?"]="Que faz aqui, $r?"
G["What are you doing here, Chen Stormstout?"]="Que faz aqui, Chen Cerveja de Trovão?"
G["What are you doing here?"]="Que faz aqui?"
