G["What have you done,  Isillien? You once fought with honor, for the good of our people... and now... you have murdered my boy..."]="Que fez, Isilhien? Hubo um dia no que luchabas com honra, pelo bem de nossa gente... e agora... tem asesinado a meu chico..."
