G["What is it now, $c, I haven't got all day? The Horde has completed its collections and now waits only on the Alliance to organize themselves and do the same. Perhaps you should be out there looking for the pieces to the Scepter of the Shifting Sands so that you can ring the gong at the Scarab Dais, opening the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and thereby starting the war?"]="Que passa agora, $c? Não tenho tudo o dia! A Horda já reuniu tudo o necessário e agora está à espera de que a Aliança se organice e hagao mesmo. Talvez deveria procurar os pedaços do cetro do Mar de Dunas pai reconstruirlo e assim fazer soar o gongo situado no Estrado do Besouro pai abrir as portões de Ahn'Qiraj e começar à guerra."
G["What is it now, Gravel?"]="Que acontece, Gravel?"
G["What is it that you do exactly, Rohan?"]="O que você faz exatamente, Rohan?"
