G["Who dares interfere with the business of the Defias Brotherhood?  Die $C!"]="Quem se atreve a interferir nos assuntos da Guilda Défias? Morre, $c!"
G["Who dares interrupt my work!? Show yourself, coward!"]="Quem osa interromper meu trabalho? Muéstrate, covarde!"
