G["Would you kindly show me the way back to Kunlai?"]="Serías tão gentil de decirme como voltar a Kun-Lai?"
G["Would you like a flight to Rut'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?"]="Gostaria de um voo pai Rut'theran Village, cortesia do Círculo Cenarion?"
G["Would you like a flight to Thunder Bluff, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?"]="Gostaria de um voo pai Thunder Bluff, cortesia do Círculo Cenarion?"
