G["Wow!  The laughs don't drop very often here, do they?"]="Vá! Não os echáis muitas risas por aqui, verdade?"
G["Wow!  These kegs are filled with powerful stuff!  They lift me right out of my boots!"]="Vá! Estes barris têm coisa fina! Belo subidón!"
