G["You will welcome these former heroes of the Horde and treat them with the respect that you would give to any ally of Orgrimmar!"]="Daréis a boas-vindas a estes antigos heróis da Horda e os trataréis com o mesmo respeito que a qualquer aliado de Orgrimmar!"
