G["[PH] Dat Saurok be their commander. Take him out, now!"]="Resil"
G["[PH] De Saurok been created by da Mogu?"]="Resil"
G["[PH] Dis cave be lookin dangerous. You three split up, one of you man dis cannon here and de rest of you split up in de caves."]="Resil"
